      "writtenOn": "2013-01-22T07:26:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Lets discuss how to solve no 1.\n\nWhen it comes to item 2.\nThe application calls utility methods for handling the DRM files.\nThese common utility methods may create a DMC and call canhandle and checkrights.\nRight now the it\u0027s not enough to do the release() call. The fd:s are not released until the application terminates. If you are running i.e. the media player for a long time you will leak fd:s for each utility call and will crash eventually.",
